        NoLossCheck -->|fail| Escalate["retry, escalate to full-transcript mode,<br/>or open a human_gate — never a silent partial"]
        FullLedgerWrite --> NextEngine["next EngineAdapter resumes the job<br/>(seed_prompt reaches it byte-for-byte)"]
    end

